  {
   "Post-QDC Policy Key": "Research stays",
   "": "Company facts calls rarely cover. Research remains the source unless manually edited."
  },
  {
   "Post-QDC Policy Key": "Confirm/correct",
   "": "Research seeds the value as a hypothesis. Transcript pass confirms or corrects it; field shows which happened."
  },
  {
   "Post-QDC Policy Key": "Transcript takes over",
   "": "Call answer is authoritative. Research value is replaced and demoted to history once the prospect states the fact."
  },
  {
   "Post-QDC Policy Key": "Source precedence (proposed)",
   "": "Manual > Transcript > Research. Higher source never silently overwritten by lower. Every value carries source + history."
  }
